 ## The Practical Application
 
-Track your type's hormone. Not clinically — phenomenologically. When does melatonin's rhythm feel disrupted in a Type 1? When moral order is violated. When does cortisol spike in a Type 5? When someone demands more than the resource budget allows. When does adrenaline flood a Type 8? When control is threatened.
+Notice which parts of the symbolic pairing feel recognisable, and which do not. A sensation of urgency cannot tell you an adrenaline concentration; a personality description cannot supply that measurement.
 
-The celestial overlay is timing. Meteor showers activate type-specific transformation windows. The Leonid shower is Type 8's annual audit. Monoceros is Type 5's annual data download. These are not astrological predictions. They are pattern recognition protocols applied to celestial mechanics.
+The celestial overlay proposes a timing interpretation. Meteor showers do not establish type-specific transformation windows merely by occupying a place in the matrix.
 
-The matrix does not tell you who you are. It tells you what your system was designed to process, through which chemical channel, at which cosmic frequency. The free will is in what you do with that information.
+A row may suggest a creative question. It cannot tell you which chemical channel carries your personality or assign a cosmic frequency to your work.
 
-The nine Muses are still singing. The question is whether you can hear which one is yours.
